@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5436
@RiderId = 1

### Export expenses as CSV
### Downloads all expense records for the authenticated rider as expenses-export.csv
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/exports/expenses
X-User-Id: {{RiderId}}

###

### Export ride history as ZIP
### Downloads all ride records as a per-year ZIP archive: ride-history-export.zip
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/exports/rides
X-User-Id: {{RiderId}}

###
